New Volcantum is the place on [[Geography/Ushas/index|Ushas]] where most of the world's people live. It was built on land that [[People/Dorcan|Dorcan]] raised out of the [[Phenomena/The Pale|Pale]] after the old landmasses were lost, and it takes its name from Old Volcantum, which no longer exists. Most of the Ushans who serve [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]] grew up there.

Old Volcantum was founded by the party that would found [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]], once they had made their fortune in the first half of the [[Geography/Ushas/Undermountain|Undermountain]] and left Waterdeep. They made alliances and trade deals with other cities and built up its forces, and [[People/Rotok|Rotok]]'s church later spread its influence across the world.
